# The zizmor job's tool (.github/workflows/zizmor.yml): zizmor, the static analyser for GitHub
# Actions workflows (docs.zizmor.sh). One package with no dependencies: the wheel carries the
# compiled binary. That job holds `security-events: write`, so nothing it installs floats. Wheels
# only.
#
# pip-compile turns this into zizmor.txt: exact version AND hashes, installed with
# `--require-hashes`. Dependabot keeps it current by re-running pip-compile on the Python its
# header names (3.11). Edit THIS file, then regenerate (run in python:3.11-slim):
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --no-annotate --strip-extras --output-file=zizmor.txt zizmor.in
zizmor
